{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028102001:0":{"text":"휴윈 양, 만나서 반가워요! 목소리에 힘이 없는데 아직 마력이 회복되지 않았나요? 하지만 부패는 이미 사라졌는데...","source_cn":"伊温小姐，真高兴见到你！你的声音有些虚弱，是魔力还没恢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x639E6C356ECFE746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028102002:0":{"text":"정화의 비를 유지하느라 마력을 다 써버렸어요... 마력 일부는 빗방울과 함께 흩어졌고요.","source_cn":"我……维持净化之雨透支了我的魔力……有些魔力随雨水散逸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EE395C4DA43D71F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028102003:0":{"text":"그래서... 아직 완전히 회복하지 못했어요.","source_cn":"所以……我现在还没有完全恢复。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42C0843F7164DAC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028102004:0":{"text":"흩어진 마력을 되찾으면 되지 않을까요?","source_cn":"把散逸掉的魔力找回来不就行了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5F5485247646424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028102005:1":{"text":"이론적으론 그래요. 다만... 흩어진 마력이 조금 특별해서, 일반적인 방법으로는 회수하기 어려워요.","source_cn":"理论上是的。可是我散逸的魔力有些……特殊，很难用普通方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CA1B59B819BF83B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028102006:1":{"text":"음, 휴윈 양의 마력은 어떤 점이 특별한가요?","source_cn":"咦，伊温小姐的魔力有什么特别的地方呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3E066D316EE8672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028102007:1":{"text":"제 마력의 근원은... 물이에요. 정화의 비를 유지하기 위해 제 감정과 기억의 조각들이 비의 마력에 녹아들었죠.","source_cn":"我的魔力本源是……水。为了维持净化之雨，我的情感和一些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41099E9294B75A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028102008:1":{"text":"마력을 함부로 흡수하면 오히려 기억이 파괴될 수도 있어요... 모두 너무 소중한 기억들이라 잃어버리고 싶지 않고요...","source_cn":"如果粗蛮地吸收魔力，可能反而会破坏它们……那些是很重要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E64A581E0F033D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028102009:1":{"text":"흑... “물은 모든 걸 기억한다”라는 말처럼... 휴윈 양의 마법은 이런 원리였군요.","source_cn":"都说“记忆如水”……原来伊温小姐的魔法原理是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52B73DE8FB2CA298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1028102009":{"text":"흑... “물은 모든 걸 기억한다”라는 말처럼... 휴윈 양의 마법은 이런 원리였군요.","source_cn":"都说“记忆如水”……原来伊温小姐的魔法原理是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52B73DE8FB2CA298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028102010:1":{"text":"음... 「마법의 기초 구성 이론」에 따르면, 기억에 관한 마법은 기억과 연관된 물건을 매개체로 하면 안전하게 다룰 수 있다고 했어욧!","source_cn":"嗯……我记得在《魔法基础构成理论》中读到过，关于记忆的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325E4DDE8AE1AA86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028102011:1":{"text":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 휴윈 양의 마력이 잘 흐르도록 도와줄 테니 문제없을 거예요!","source_cn":"再加上<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE098C36DBDDD0EF3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 휴윈 양의 마력이 잘 흐르도록 도와줄 테니 문제없을 거예요!","female":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 휴윈 양의 마력이 잘 흐르도록 도와줄 테니 문제없을 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"112218","variant_female_record_index":"112219","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1028102011":{"text":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 휴윈 양의 마력이 잘 흐르도록 도와줄 테니 문제없을 거예요!","source_cn":"再加上<style=stress><player_name></style>可以帮伊温小姐精妙地控制魔力流动，应该就没有问题了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE098C36DBDDD0EF3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 휴윈 양의 마력이 잘 흐르도록 도와줄 테니 문제없을 거예요!","female":"게다가 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님도 휴윈 양의 마력이 잘 흐르도록 도와줄 테니 문제없을 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"112218","variant_female_record_index":"112219","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028102012:1":{"text":"고마워요... 또 신세를 지게 됐네요...","source_cn":"谢谢……又要麻烦你们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE9FA778844DDED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028102013:1":{"text":"신세라뇹! 휴윈 양, 기억의 조각을 안정시킬 매개체로 뭐가 좋을까요?","source_cn":"不要这么客气嘛~那么，伊温小姐知道有什么东西可以作为稳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8F62C80F169DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028102014:0":{"text":"기억과 관련된 물건이라... 음, 타란 마을에서 <style=\"highlight\">결혼식 때 쓰는 화관</style>이 좋을 것 같아요...","source_cn":"和记忆有关的物品……我想，大概，我需要一顶塔兰村人在<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA63013C6F9D029E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028102015:1":{"text":"화관? 타란 마을의 결혼식에서는 화관을 쓰는군요. 처음 알았네요.","source_cn":"花冠？塔兰村的婚礼竟然还有这种习俗呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC522477D34C27FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028102016:1":{"text":"치피에게 맡겨주세요, 휴윈 양. 바로 찾아올게요!","source_cn":"交给我们吧，伊温小姐，我们这就去找！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D3C5A34188A3F38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"내게 맡겨","source_cn":"交给我吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","